                        ],
                        "form": "блези́ре"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "2235b70b-bad6-4787-ac83-4eaabb20c644",
                        "entry_id": "f06cc67e-c85e-36d0-a4c6-ceaec7e8a71c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "блези́рах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13aa63a9-4c02-3a15-8271-79c0f071a4a3",
                        "entry_id": "f06cc67e-c85e-36d0-a4c6-ceaec7e8a71c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. или шутл. удовольствие, забава"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8e9f859-bb7b-4708-88e4-9fafbc7c4de1",
                                "sense_id": "13aa63a9-4c02-3a15-8271-79c0f071a4a3",
                                "text": "Хозяйка .. сначала требовала, чтобы Павел Константиныч прогнал жену от себя, но он умолял, да и она сама сказала это больше для блезиру, чем для дела."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82cc118a-58a6-4063-8583-846832e7f654",
                                "sense_id": "13aa63a9-4c02-3a15-8271-79c0f071a4a3",
                                "text": "— \"Куда, — спросят, — девать нового генерала?\" — \"Валяй его в заштатные!\" С протекцией причислят тебя к какой-нибудь комиссии… для сокращения комиссий… Простись тогда, душка Петр Никанорович, с окладом и другими блезирами из остаточных! «Нет, — скажут, — здесь не полагается!»"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1c55cf9-d07e-3104-b40a-fb77c7558729",
                        "entry_id": "f06cc67e-c85e-36d0-a4c6-ceaec7e8a71c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., устар. или шутл. видимость, проформа"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b92db0e-1295-4d13-a4ec-b7773282b68c",
                                "sense_id": "a1c55cf9-d07e-3104-b40a-fb77c7558729",
                                "text": "Если и появляются щи, то это только один блезир, как говорят рабочие, или ещё характернее по их выражению: «Наши щи хоть кнутом хлещи ― пузыря не вскочит»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70bbfa6c-9c02-4b94-bc7a-9baa7f58797a",
                                "sense_id": "a1c55cf9-d07e-3104-b40a-fb77c7558729",
                                "text": "Никто не пил. Лизнули рюмки, как говорила покойная мама, ради блезира."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7dcb4cca-326f-4b48-a51d-7e015a2a3703",
                        "source_entry_id": "f06cc67e-c85e-36d0-a4c6-ceaec7e8a71c",
                        "source_sense_description": "удовольствие",
                        "target_lang_word": "pleasure",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pleasure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state of being pleased or contented; gratification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e64ae5bd-8491-4b02-96b0-c897c7e8deca",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                                "text": "He remembered with pleasure his home and family."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d18ac841-69ed-43de-b700-543220eccc67",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                                "text": "I get a lot of pleasure from watching others work hard while I relax."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a4a43b6-b5dd-4ef5-b136-c2ebd3bb84ef",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                                "text": "But the only statistic that will concern West Brom will be the scoreline, and their manager Roy Hodgson will take considerable pleasure from a victory over the club he managed for just 191 days."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61d55290-fadf-49fb-9609-4d5beb58112b",
                                                "sense_id": "ba0ee9c0-4ecd-3cd7-9e7f-24f74e2cc8c7",
                                                "text": "Maximize all the pleasure / Even with all this weather / Nothing can make it better / Maximize all the pleasure"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person, thing or action that causes enjoyment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94268250-5fd0-4418-8bc6-037fad46b86b",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "It was a pleasure to meet you."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afcc1f63-7e92-4079-a9f8-b196ed888511",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "Having a good night's sleep is one of life's little pleasures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4f239c4-b995-497b-b4c8-e4226aea30a4",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "Festus, willing to do the Jews a pleasure"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46bde89f-022e-463c-912e-9a5b2f854ff8",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "The humor of my proposition appealed more strongly to Miss Trevor than I had looked for, and from that time forward she became her old self again;[…]. Now she had come to look upon the matter in its true proportions, and her anticipation of a possible chance of teaching him a lesson was a pleasure to behold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "073252fc-723e-49e9-a809-d7cb2f7016e1",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a1e3d2-19a5-39a5-bda7-82e50c3dd292",
                                                "text": "In order to grant the rich these pleasures, the social contract is reconfigured. The welfare state is dismantled. […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "707bba07-6eb3-38ac-aa95-61e0acd0047d",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexual enjoyment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b647f35-f442-37c6-8e53-a5e1b47edf12",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One's preference."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73100b93-0a00-4a65-9b08-d1c74796e99f",
                                                "sense_id": "5b647f35-f442-37c6-8e53-a5e1b47edf12",
                                                "text": "What is your pleasure: coffee or tea?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                        "entry_id": "403e76c4-ac4c-3f6e-b4b1-f9a69de67f9e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The will or desire of someone or some agency in power."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "formal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c0fb057-8dfa-4549-bda1-3b43c4c8998c",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "to hold an office at pleasure: to hold it indefinitely until it is revoked"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b73d63e-6cb8-4095-b5a4-7135950a9c02",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "to be imprisoned at Her Majesty's pleasure: to be imprisoned indefinitely"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46e1f96a-a5f4-44d0-905e-ba7120356105",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "at Congress's pleasure: whenever or as long as Congress desires"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e20f195f-21c1-46b1-a8fe-ad0414c4a66b",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "Use your pleasure; if your love do not persuade you to come, let not my letter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9790494-fc94-4a96-9f60-fdeeb0854a1a",
                                                "sense_id": "da8cb7df-9a2b-30c2-9b8e-f87d83b72c49",
                                                "text": "He will do his pleasure on Babylon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pleasure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea4eaf3f-048b-318b-846c-6771b294369f",
                                        "entry_id": "681e1659-fbd0-367f-9d90-95c2e4e2fa7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "pleased to meet you, \\\"It's my pleasure\\"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pleasure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "841ee67b-1463-3ed3-988b-c0401d437a4a",
                                        "entry_id": "9abf9ff5-c3bc-3b94-9cbb-0a7844a1a69f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To give or afford pleasure to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "460e7b56-847d-4315-b564-9350b6b57dba",
                                                "sense_id": "841ee67b-1463-3ed3-988b-c0401d437a4a",
                                                "text": "[H]e / [...] / Had tost his ball and flown his kite, and roll'd / His hoop to pleasure Edith, [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44875027-d27d-355d-b557-20e4ccaeab0e",
                                        "entry_id": "9abf9ff5-c3bc-3b94-9cbb-0a7844a1a69f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To give sexual pleasure to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14b5f9f3-8f96-46f4-a7d5-66e529ecf341",
                                                "sense_id": "44875027-d27d-355d-b557-20e4ccaeab0e",
                                                "text": "Johnny pleasured Jackie with his mouth last night."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fabbb31a-1d69-30d5-92c5-1c689ff00a91",
                                        "entry_id": "9abf9ff5-c3bc-3b94-9cbb-0a7844a1a69f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take pleasure; to seek or pursue pleasure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e994730a-b47a-410d-9091-bfb18b55b603",
                                                "sense_id": "fabbb31a-1d69-30d5-92c5-1c689ff00a91",
                                                "text": "to go pleasuring"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60dce518-bcf6-40ef-bb79-c63eafcc271c",
                        "source_entry_id": "f06cc67e-c85e-36d0-a4c6-ceaec7e8a71c",
                        "source_sense_description": "видимость, проформа",
                        "target_lang_word": "formality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "formality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29f91ae9-7056-31cc-b130-e0d75e7a356c",
                                        "entry_id": "c4ffd979-d3b7-391f-9109-eba3185f13c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being formal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "038fe986-feac-4e68-9584-77fbf87a458a",
                                                "sense_id": "29f91ae9-7056-31cc-b130-e0d75e7a356c",
                                                "text": "[S]uch an one […] recalls as a vision of Paradise the land he has learnt to love; he exaggerates the insalubrity of a northern climate; he bewails the wretched formality of our civilised life, and so, back to the distant solitudes flies his recollection like a dove to the wilderness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1dbfd038-34fb-38c7-9e39-797513f6149f",
                                        "entry_id": "c4ffd979-d3b7-391f-9109-eba3185f13c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something said or done as a matter of form."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a09a9cc8-d6f9-3fd4-9a42-ecccac545f40",
                                        "entry_id": "c4ffd979-d3b7-391f-9109-eba3185f13c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A customary ritual without substance, real consequence, or unique meaning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0ab4b6f-fc87-433f-aa5e-8152d71c368d",
                                                "sense_id": "a09a9cc8-d6f9-3fd4-9a42-ecccac545f40",
                                                "text": "The examination for priesthood is no mere formality, so we have to study well."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1089fb1-342b-3d23-ba7d-2ec7c94aadbf",
